// Winning labeled score minus the next of the eight.
// No pair returns nothing. A tie at the top is zero.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE margin ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG margin rank

IMPULSE margin 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "margin" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
